              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">#### 5. AI-Driven Drug Discovery &amp; Clinical Trial Optimization</span>                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">*   **Accelerated Molecule Design:** Generative AI models simulate complex protein interactions and design </span>    <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">novel therapeutic molecules in days rather than years, reducing early-stage R&amp;D timelines by over 60%.</span>         <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">*   **Optimized Clinical Trials:** AI identifies suitable clinical trial candidates using decentralized </span>       <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
