              "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">In 2026, AI in healthcare is no longer a peripheral technology; it is an indispensable clinical partner. By </span>   <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
